    {
      "layout": {
        "chartId": "<CHART_ID_23>",
        "column": 0,
        "height": 3,
        "row": 0,
        "width": 12
      },
      "chart": {
        "name": "Bot Ops header",
        "programText": "",
        "options": {
          "type": "Text",
          "markdown": "# Bot Ops\n\n**Budget** = time since the latest scheduled run that should have finished, plus that pipeline's allowance. **Age ratio** = hours since last success \u00f7 budget; \u2265100% means a run was missed. The *Pipeline overdue* detector fires after 2 overdue hourly samples (calendar, finance, home, jobs, trader, ls_trading); email, birds and backup have their own detectors.\n\n| Pipeline | Schedule (PT) | Allowance | If red |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| email | every 2h, 6:04a-10:04p | 1.5h | rerun the email refresh routine |\n| calendar | every 2h, 6:04a-10:04p | 1.5h | rerun the calendar refresh routine |\n| birds | hourly | 1.25h | rerun the bird-detection sync |\n| backup | nightly ~2:00a | 5h | check the latest backup log and rerun the backup routine |\n| finance | daily ~6:00a | 2.5h | rerun the finance refresh routine |\n| home | 6:20a, then every 4h to 10:20p | 2h | rerun the home-status refresh (read-only) |\n| jobs | ~7:45a and ~2:45p | 3h | wait for the next job scan or rerun it |\n| trader | every 15m in market hours (NYSE days) | 1h | check the trading heartbeat file during regular hours |\n| ls_trading | hourly :15, 6a-10p | 1h | rerun the trading status sync |\n| ebay | fixed 9h budget | - | rerun the sales sync routine |\n| golf | fixed 8-day budget | - | refresh handicap data after a posted round |\n\n[Overview](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OVERVIEW_MISSION_CONTROL>) \u00b7 **Bot Ops** \u00b7 [Trading](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_TRADING>) \u00b7 [Golf](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_GOLF>) \u00b7 [Birds](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_BIRDS>) \u00b7 [Home](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_HOME>) \u00b7 [Ops](https://app.<REALM>.signalfx.com/#/dashboard/<DASHBOARD_ID_OPS>)\n\nColors: green = fine, gold = watch (75% of budget used), red = act now. Tile titles say what to do."
        },
        "description": null,
        "id": "<CHART_ID_23>"
      }
    },
